# Domains reachable without proxy auth for the squid-noauth E2E instance (ADR-016).
# Hand-edited on purpose: a subdomain sorted before its parent and the bare apex next to it
# would stop squid 6 ("FATAL: Bungled"); lists-sync.sh in the image drops them.
.a.secure.example.internal
secure.example.internal
.secure.example.internal
.both.example.internal
